5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to fix the fee structure before choosing a place.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,Last year’s sleep quality was terrible. I want to check the lodging details.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am worried about how much work the organizers had to do.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The budget is still in the red from last year. I need to see the costs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,The year groups barely talk. I want to see who actually shows up.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Misaki, if we pick a place with hidden costs, the fee will be wrong again.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minato, if the organizers are burned out, the camp fails. I agree with you.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shion, yes. I think we should look at the transport receipts too.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Asuka, I will look at the public rates. It seems the most transparent.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, I will check the attendance sheets. I need to know who is missing.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look at the whole-building terms. It clarifies who pays for dropouts.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will check the accounts from other clubs. I want to know the reality of the rooms.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will look at the canteen closure. Cooking takes too much time.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will also check the group transport receipts. It is a big expense.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will check what the seniors say about mixing. It is important for the club.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
