35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The whole-building terms are strict. Non-refundable deposits mean we absorb late dropouts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,The inland clubs slept eight to a room. Lights out at eleven. That explains the fatigue.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,The canteen closes. Cooking took two hours a day. We need a place with staff.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Transport is 38% of the cost if we go far. Public beds are 1,100 yen a night.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,A fifth of the club never came. The seniors say mixing only happens in shared evenings.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Misaki, if transport is that high, a local option might be cheaper overall.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minato, if we have to cook, we lose training time. I agree with your concern.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shion, yes. The cooking duty was too heavy. I hope we can avoid it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Asuka, the public rate is fixed. It is predictable. I prefer that for the budget.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, if we sleep badly, the training suffers. I need to know the room setup.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The public rate sheet includes hall use. That simplifies the accounting.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,"The lottery is six months ahead. If we miss it, we are stuck.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,The transport receipts show how much we spent last time. It was a lot.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I am glad the public rate is clear. I can calculate the fee accurately now.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Takumi,,The attendance sheets are worrying. We need a place that brings people together.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
